    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9709f2f03e74ee6b038424</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：CC / 哲</span><br><br><span>实际上这才是今年录制的第一期！（虽然上一期是今年发布的第一期）</span><br><span>阔别了大半年的CC和哲一起聊了聊最近最近最近的生活，她们的生活都来到了新的阶段，也发生了新的变化❤</span><br><span>---</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">00:11:42</a> CC厨房置物架：宜家奥马尔</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbjiNZ9Uu5X7by9Qxm0SkvYWb42.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">00:18:50</a> 哲的落地灯：洛德佛利</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk39c6m5vlCrTjLvr0fOyK8xDr0w.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">00:19:30</a> 哲养小猫啦！爸爸妈妈的真香时刻~ </span><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBNgHWV-LvnkgDm0_Cp-PA3rmUS.jpg"><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">00:31:45</a> 天目里很美啊👇</span><em><span>（图片来自网络）</span></em></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZyduDFrSxVcX78oxIqNU_Vg4ie.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">00:32:36</a> Gelato集市：不是雪力是芭菲杯啦！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FukkkVJOQ9P7kMaXke4Gm6CRDkhh.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2154">00:35:54</a> 不是大米先生，冰激凌是野人先生！（看一下bean go👇）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtF5BNsGmMH9RrLMhNX4t3MTSPww.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">00:41:07</a> 步入上流了！一起来学拉花和品酒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2962">00:49:22</a> 运动健身：听说精力是可以锻炼的？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3488">00:58:08</a> 架子鼓女孩：来点贝斯笑话</span></p><hr><hr><p><span>--</span></p><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge; (</span><a href="http://incompetech.com" data-url="http://incompetech.com"><span>incompetech.com</span></a><span>)</span></p><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a><br><br><span>片尾曲： Under Pressure by Queen</span></p>]]></description>
