    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：CC / 鱼油</span></p><p><span>这期嘉宾邀请到了在《反转魅力》出现过的@鱼油</span></p><p><span>作为从小学就开始同校的老熟人，我们一起聊了聊从小到大曾经有过的奇思妙想（幻想）——由于认识时间太长，有些回忆我们甚至还互相见证。</span></p><p><span>有的只是三分钟热度，有的我们稍稍付出了一点行动。</span></p><p><span>但比起一个真正的主题分享，这期的内容更像是阔别已久的超级老友回忆“童年+青春”的怀旧畅聊...</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 鱼油：小学就有idol病</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> CC：奇葩说种子选手幼年形态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 鱼油：黑白大厨应该请我的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> CC：高中就有学术梦了</span></p><p><span>以及后面源源不断地红人梦...</span></p><p><span>---</span></p><hr><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge; Bossa-Antigua (</span><a href="http://incompetech.com" data-url="http://incompetech.com"><span>incompetech.com</span></a><span>)</span></p><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
