  <item>
    <title>金九银十秋招季：一本英硕0offer，我们做对（cuo）了什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691b4cb8cbba038b420383be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691b4cb8cbba038b420383be</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 17:30:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：CC / 哲</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能是苦笑最多的一期...</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是我们坦诚地剖白我们的心路历程、求职心得、身边样本，希望“至少你不是一个人”这点多多少少能够安慰到你！</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 我们各自的bg</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> 秋招以来，我们的心态正暗自发生着变化...</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> 面试官一番话居然让哲重拾吉他&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> CC在新的城市重建生活秩序</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 来自牛人朋友们的peer pressure</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1847">30:47</a> 心态调整根本就是说一套做一套</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">36:17</a> 总结的求职心得-你确定你的所有产出都被关注到了吗</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a> 求职信息渠道的拓展</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3054">50:54</a> 你有没有为networking拼过命</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3526">58:46</a> 真的有超多感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">1:03:00</a> 身边人样本放送</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：2F 年轻人 （by 落日飞车）</span></p>]]></description>
