    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：哲</span></p><span></span><p><span>好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目是在英国初夏录制的一期存货，CC和哲一起回顾了六月发生的吃喝玩乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>尽管描述的是一些夏日受用的生活指南，但剪辑过程中发现对这个初冬似乎也同样适用呢：）</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃喝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 清新开胃的东南亚菜系 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 快手日式豆乳拉面的制作方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 抹茶、泰奶冰激凌 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 关于牛油果奶昔的二三事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> IPA入门指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>玩乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 游泳+桑拿真是妙 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> 捏泥陶艺太解压！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> V&amp;A东伦敦新馆见闻 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> 约克一整幢的中古店</span></p><span></span><p><span>视听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> 电影推荐：幸福的拉扎罗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2308">38:28</a> 悬疑两件套：《心灵猎人》+《十二宫》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2733">45:33</a> 哲的歌单：《汉密尔顿》《致埃文汉森》以及 she her her hers</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3141">52:21</a> CC：《Brat》狂粉以及Fred Again</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
