  <item>
    <title>Loser还是Winner？我们高考完才明白的事...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6846199179e285b9b8e43cba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6846199179e285b9b8e43cba</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小E / CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：JOJO</span></p><span></span><p><span>高考——有人说是人生的分水岭，有人觉得只是一场普通的考试。多年后再回头看，当年的‘Winner’真的赢了吗？‘Loser’又是否真的输了？这期节目里，我们聊了高考当天的魔幻现实，填志愿时的信息差惨案，以及那些‘考完一定要通宵打游戏’的叛逆时刻……</span></p><span></span><p><span>但更重要的是，我们讨论了高考后的这些年，如何重新定义‘输赢’——</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>毕竟，人生可比一张试卷复杂多了。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>🎓你高考那年有哪些离谱/深刻回忆？现在的你，是当年的「Winner」还是「Loser」？留言告诉我们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 一个词概括高考记忆：有人平淡有人虚幻&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> </span><strong><span>高考当天离谱回忆</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> 搞什么啊？我怎么能看到别人的卷子啊？！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> 考试期间照常通宵那又怎？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> 高考：心态才是终极BOSS</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> </span><strong><span>放榜 &amp; 选专业：人生第一次大型赌博</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a></span><em><span>「别拦我，我真的想去复读！」</span></em><span> —— E的执念与转折</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> JO的阴差阳错：</span><em><span>「误打误撞去了新闻系」</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> C: </span><em><span>「</span></em><em><span>高校实际招生状况与填报志愿的信息真的很不对称</span></em><em><span>...」</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> </span><strong><span>即使上了大学我也没去自己喜欢的专业</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> C的存在主义危机如何被化解</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a> JO弃理从文——从后悔到知足</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> E喜欢自己的专业：看到专业在现实中的落地</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a> </span><strong><span>‘我高考完的那个夏天’：当然要狠狠享受！</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2151">35:51</a> 高考完一定要打游戏的若干个原因</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2207">36:47</a> </span><strong><span>再回首：高考绝不是人生中最重要的事</span></strong><strong><span>....</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6619ba050b37a56aebe5fdac/lvFHnezx5y8glFhc5wydr2CG0pR9.m4a" length="47871615" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fta1Jym2OYKtNuQjysCf0oLoI8iL.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>谁懂英国留子啊，调料难买、火车停摆、冬天天黑得比心碎还快</title>
