    <guid isPermaLink="false">683e23ef38dcc57c6436531a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Jun 2025 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果你即将来英国留学，或者已经来了但还在为“怎么买菜”“为什么火车又罢工了”“冬天到底怎么过”这些问题抓狂——这期播客就是为你准备的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们从亲身踩坑经验出发，一次性聊透了在英国生活的</span><strong><span>衣食住行+精神续命指南</span></strong><span>，包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>住哪更不踩雷？学校宿舍 vs 找房子合租，有哪些坑和优点；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>做饭靠啥活着？调料带什么、以及我们在“食物洼地”的顽强生存；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>穿什么才保命？英国冬天是北方冷，还是江浙沪冷；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>交通有多随机？火车说停就停、廉航让你错过人生；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>冬令时到底有多难熬？天黑得比心碎还快，我们靠什么撑下来了？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 租房篇：租房渠道和平台有哪些？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> -在英区生活什么样的房子才算在好地段？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> -ensuite和studio到底怎么选？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a> 吃喝篇：最推荐行前带的厨具和调料</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> -聊聊目前我们的拿手菜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> -酒蒙子友好的欧洲：试试IPA！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 服饰篇：‘你都在哪里买衣服啊？’</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a> 交通篇：《英区乘火车须知》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">37:07</a> -致我们遇到的那些罢工</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a> -咱们坐廉航也是坐出经验来了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> 冬令时篇：没有大表哥，只能自己救自己！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">45:34</a> 维生素和活动安排要两手抓！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a> ‘不会只有我们学校考试周才有抚慰犬/羊驼吧~’</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRqHDa79uLUdDZXulwWo5XRoMSZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
