  <item>
    <title>爆笑方言：南京vs云南vs吴语vs粤语——吵起来谁最凶？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68193e9447ebeede7eeb3320</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68193e9447ebeede7eeb3320</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 May 2025 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小E / CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Tony / 小Jo</span></p><span></span><p><span>南京人一急就上器官，云南人语速快得像在斗嘴，吴语区南通人张口“要死要活”，粤语听着轻飘飘，但只有懂的人才知道那句话多致命。今天节目中的四位英国留子不仅用家乡话上演了爆笑互怼（文明版），更聊出了方言背后那些外人听不懂的乡愁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从街头俚语到快要失传的谚语，从语音差异到身份认同，这既是一场方言Battle，更是一次关于文化根脉的温暖对话。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢 </span><strong><span>欢迎来评论区分享一句“只有你们那儿才说得出”的方言句子！</span></strong><br><span>说不定下一期我们就读出来，翻译不翻译都得听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a> 欢乐直达跳跃点：趣味方言介绍（纯享版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 四种方言和大家问好~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 上次说方言是什么时候？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 方言带来的归属感：从骂人抒发到身份认同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> 你那里的方言正在消失吗？你会教你的下一代方言吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> “方言羞耻”到底是怎么回事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a> 南京人的呼唤：十三太保何时才能团结？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 各自方言里的特别表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a> 看过来！当地人教你地道地怼天怼地！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2443">40:43</a> 一人教一句最常用的方言：下次旅游就用上！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">44:24</a> 你的方言里有顺口溜吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2811">46:51</a> 想要继续了解某一门方言的话，我该怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6619ba050b37a56aebe5fdac/lpXo0jlaNCVj9mI6_8zNY9MzPDNJ.m4a" length="48048511" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fta1Jym2OYKtNuQjysCf0oLoI8iL.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
