  <item>
    <title>春假归来！意大利&amp;加州旅游回忆大放送！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68153d956970cc7b4d6b6e1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68153d956970cc7b4d6b6e1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 May 2025 22:32:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小E / CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>同庆小长假！大家的五一假期去哪里玩呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们回顾各自的春假旅行，一个在意大利走断腿，一个在美国养膘放空，</span><strong><span>同样的假期，不一样的节奏，连“放松”也发生了错位。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>---</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 前往意大利/加州前的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a> 流连忘返的威尼斯！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> CC的加州之旅安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> 惊悚的好莱坞环球影城：我再也不怕过山车了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a> 艺术之神降临了：乌菲兹美术馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a> NAPA的日式红酒庄：我何时才能如此有钱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a> 在意大利的不愉快：与疯子同车，看谁呛得过谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1954">32:34</a> 好惊喜！被意大利大妈贴面吻了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> C在LA和别人录了情感播客~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2452">40:52</a> “Ta要是喜欢女生就好了！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 意大利&amp;加州的美食大放送</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>提及的乌菲兹美术馆藏画：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_cB7H_67TcPRWV-frCUI2g42E4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkmH8nlVvV_vKornxCodbpOuf6ue.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuEa6RppnypHpF-1Lr9kgffib5uZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>像黄翡的小溪：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv5Niy9OzMavbx3UGN3oMM68e7mR.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
