  <item>
    <title>土过才时髦：我们的时尚进化史！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6802af711f1db84a563293a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6802af711f1db84a563293a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Apr 2025 20:10:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小E / CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：无情</span></p><span></span><p><span>想起旗安84画的那部漫画《时尚王》，主角全身上下都透着“刻意打扮却哪里不太对”的气息，穿搭像在做大冒险，但他依然坚信：</span><strong><span>“帅就是一种信念。”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——说实话，我们仨好像也都经历过这种“信念式穿搭”的时期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们分享各自的</span><strong><span>风格进化史（aka 时尚黑历史）</span></strong><span>：</span><br><span>有人被校服压抑多年，一解放就开始迷恋限量球鞋，甚至直接下海卖鞋；</span><br><span>有人小时候穿搭被家人肯定，高考完却被点名“该减肥”，大学靠穿成“金融男”证明自己不一样，出国之后反手躺平；</span><br><span>还有人从小热爱穿搭但始终缺点自信，直到近几年才意识到：</span><strong><span>“原来我一直很知道自己喜欢什么。”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>整期节目笑料频出，黑历史满天飞，还加入了</span><strong><span>互相描述风格的“社死环节”</span></strong><span>，比自夸更准确，比自嘲更扎心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👕 如果你也穿错过、试错过、痛骂过自己的买家秀照片，那你一定会懂我们。</span><br><span>毕竟，</span><strong><span>风格不是一夜找对的，而是被岁月和尴尬穿搭一件件“逼”出来的。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>---</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 小小的我还不懂时尚！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> E之风格变迁：我好像一直都时髦（？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> 前鞋贩子的干货分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">11:09</a> 无情的发型进化史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 我也曾穿成‘金融男’</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a> CC的时尚发展史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> ‘这是百老汇风，你没听说过吗？’</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">26:19</a> 大英时尚，让我欢喜让我愁&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 三人当前风格互评：爽翻现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2733">45:33</a> 我们的时尚hot take：锐评全宇宙！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a> 一点经验之谈</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
