  <item>
    <title>彩蛋时间 | Phil在英伟达：一半是生活，一半是世界上最伟大的公司</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f31505f9578163d6633c37</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f31505f9578163d6633c37</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 00:16:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：CC&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Phil / Loopy</span></p><span></span><p><span>英伟达，AI浪潮的核心玩家，芯片界的王者。</span><br><span>在这家公司工作，是不是每天都像站在时代的风口浪尖？是不是永远在参与改变世界的决定？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和Phil聊了聊他在英伟达的生活。我们谈了大模型、芯片；也聊到他每天在工位上的琐事、下班后的生活节奏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有那种“啊我好累”式的打工叙事，这是一期关于一个人如何在高频的技术脉搏与稳定的日常节奏之间，慢慢找到自己位置的节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> 可能是最接地气的英伟达公司介绍：凭什么伟大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a> 作为英伟达insider，对deepseek的看法是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> “你预测股价什么时候回升啊？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 第一天入职的情形</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 英伟达食堂什么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 公司还在招人吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 薪资如何</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> Phil是如何进入英伟达的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1742">29:02</a> 日常有在“最伟大公司”工作的实感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> 下班依旧需要面对柴米油盐 会有割裂感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">39:33</a> Phil给想要逐梦科技大厂同学们的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
