  <item>
    <title>棉条·金酒·咖啡豆：横跨欧陆的英区购物分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67db5c3478103db3bd9cc567</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67db5c3478103db3bd9cc567</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 23:53:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小E/CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是春假前录制的最后一期节目，我们想聊聊再轻松不过的购物分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的购物车横跨四个国家，有</span><strong><span>自用觉得真香，送礼觉得靠谱</span></strong><span>的好物。从实用必备的卫生棉条，到精致又带点故事感的伴手礼，再到每天都要摸一摸的马克杯、咖啡豆，和香水。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些物品不仅是购物清单，也是我们在巴黎、冰岛、英国和国内的行走轨迹，是日常需求，也是生活方式，是细腻的实用主义，也是仪式感的小确幸。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢 </span><strong><span>你有什么跨国种草的好物？你买过最成功or最后悔的东西是什么？欢迎留言，让我们一起分享购物带来的快乐！</span></strong><span> 🎧✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次提到的产品图我们会发小红书！来这里找我们：“</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63f2815b000000001001ea0c?xsec_token=YBvqpEKrd8yNioe-ynmKP3tqzPmOl_00b1O8EXFZhHRbw=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63f2815b000000001001ea0c&amp;apptime=1742429142&amp;share_id=2068c19ab18b496eb2d8a74777842632" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63f2815b000000001001ea0c?xsec_token=YBvqpEKrd8yNioe-ynmKP3tqzPmOl_00b1O8EXFZhHRbw=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63f2815b000000001001ea0c&amp;apptime=1742429142&amp;share_id=2068c19ab18b496eb2d8a74777842632"><span>百龙Talk</span></a><span>”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 小E使用卫生棉条的心路与经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 美国之行前CC的伴手礼甄选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> 英伦庄园SPA品牌Champneys</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a> 巴黎百年茶叶店Mariage Freres</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> Brindle Distillery屡获殊荣的布谷鸟金酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 冰岛版Labubu: Skrimsli小怪兽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 写着dirty words的马克杯：Keith Brymer Jones</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a> 半个专业咖啡师E之严选咖啡豆：洪都拉斯荔枝兰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a> 令CC小小艳压学校舞会的改良旗袍：Risqué Rose</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2242">37:22</a> &nbsp;香水狂人E的取向历程：从黑鸦片到LeLabo Rose</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: In Your Arms (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
