  <item>
    <title>彩蛋时间 | 天津早饭与茄汁豆：英美留子横跨大西洋的南北对谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e4a57daf5840b33393a44d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e4a57daf5840b33393a44d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Mar 2025 01:20:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Loopy / Phil</span></p><span></span><p><span>没想到第一次直面国内南北文化的冲击是在洛杉矶！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在柔似蜜的“金海早点”，作为南方人的CC第一次吃到了北方大包子、煎饼果子——文化冲击来得比时差还猛。这期节目和生活在美国的北方朋友 Loopy和Phil，从一顿早饭聊起，一起拆解我们在海外生活中经历的</span><strong><span>南北差异</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>中西文化反差</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkaS-AkQyrp_hgXMTNkg0uqzGLqi.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>从</span><strong><span>小时候的早餐记忆</span></strong><span>到</span><strong><span>各自海外的“文化漂流”体验</span></strong><span>，我们也聊到了更深层的议题：在北美的中国人之间，那些原本属于地域的分歧，是变淡了，还是被新的</span><strong><span>财富与阶级边界</span></strong><span>重新划分？身份、距离、群体感知，这些变化是让我们走近了，还是悄悄走远了...</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 天津早点带来的饮食文化冲击！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 所以炒肝和卤煮的区别是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a> Phil记忆深处的阿亮饭团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> 作为夫妻对南北各自饮食文化的审视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a> 中美对比：北美中餐更正宗还是贵了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> 在国外南北差异更加清晰还是模糊了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">24:47</a> 英美对比：small talk惹人欢喜惹人愁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1929">32:09</a> 我们英区真的很爱逛超市！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">36:06</a> 出国多年什么在变化：怎么又聊回吃的了啊喂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 地域分歧在淡化，财富阶级的际线出现了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2609">43:29</a> 作为前辈给漂泊留子的暖心建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Samba Isobel (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6619ba050b37a56aebe5fdac/lumu-u9GqqyGE5EO70f0_wYH6UJD.m4a" length="44588106" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuh9_sbN9_17nxgL8m69M7Is2Tk0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>我当时怎么敢的？！——勇敢瞬间大盘点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67da061978103db3bd556cf4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67da061978103db3bd556cf4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 02:26:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小E/CC</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>勇敢，很多时候不是深思熟虑后的决定，而是心一横、嘴一张、脚一迈，事情就这么发生了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们聊聊那些让人心跳加速的</span><strong><span>勇敢瞬间</span></strong><span>——从小时候硬刚体育老师，到成年后说出口的分手；从私信陌生人networking，到在人生路口选择一条不一样的路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有些勇敢是冲动的，有些是克制的。但不管是哪种，都让我们在人生的某个时刻，为自己感到骄傲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢 </span><strong><span>你的勇敢瞬间是什么？是做了再怕，还是至今想起来还在后悔？欢迎留言，让我们一起回顾那些“我怎么敢的”时刻！</span></strong><span> 🎧✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 小E还手！从被怀疑自闭到没人敢惹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 硬刚时刻：体育老师又怎么惹怒了CC？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> 小E的分手如何说出口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 私信陌生人：CC也曾因networking心跳加速吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 别人都在考公赚钱，E偏要继续念书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 谢谢你JonyJ，是你教E勇敢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 走，去关心一个不太熟的朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> 当场被鼓舞：那个E心疼的好姑娘:(</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Long Stroll (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6619ba050b37a56aebe5fdac/lsRHKblw50kKaxxPCniMOdTkLXc6.m4a" length="41653738" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fta1Jym2OYKtNuQjysCf0oLoI8iL.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
