  <item>
    <title>祛魅大赏：滤镜碎了，但人生还得继续</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d89cb0dd11f9c8c14080b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d89cb0dd11f9c8c14080b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Mar 2025 00:12:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小E/CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们来聊聊“</span><strong><span>祛魅</span></strong><span>”——那些曾经被包装得闪闪发光的事物，当滤镜碎裂后，它们的真实面貌到底是什么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>· 学习好的人也会是道德标兵？你敬佩的对象明天可能就上新闻头条！</span><br><span>· 98%空气 + 2%食物的Fine dining，真的能吃出感动吗？</span><br><span>· 颜值滤镜真的能撑起一切？当完美外表碰上“谜之作风”……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祛魅是失望，还是解脱？</span></strong><span>我们真的能完全摆脱滤镜吗？本期节目，不较真，不苦大仇深，</span><strong><span>只是轻松聊聊那些曾经被我们神化的东西，是如何一步步露出它们的“凡人”一面。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你有哪些亲身经历的祛魅时刻？欢迎在评论区分享，让我们一起看看这个世界还有多少“滤镜待破碎”！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>(</span></strong><span>📢 提醒大家：本期内容轻松闲聊，涉及话题仅基于我们的观察和体验，完全不具备严谨性，听个乐就好，不必较真！ 😆</span><strong><span>)</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 学历至上主义是怎么塑造我们从前的判断的?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 英区大瓜：UCL博士哥犯罪实录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 恋综留学嘉宾说的southampton究竟何方神圣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 郑重申明:杜伦大学真的有食堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">08:44</a> 清华哥你...？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a> 所以学历好到底代表了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 主播们曾经的奢侈品幻觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> CC与她的奢侈包包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> 小E与她的品牌首饰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 法餐如何？米其林又如何？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1651">27:31</a> 苍天绕过异性恋：身边帅哥私生活大爆料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 以己为例：精装朋友圈的小E让朋友滤镜全碎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 你有没有想过情侣博主的内容是怎么制作的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2683">44:43</a> 祛魅好，祛魅坏：一些总结碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Backbay Lounge (incompetech.com)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"><span>creativecommons.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
